"""Private Android observation through a bounded native process boundary."""
from argparse import ArgumentParser
from pathlib import Path
from builtins import dict, len, isinstance
from subprocess import CompletedProcess
import hashlib
import json
import re
import subprocess
import sys

def field(record ∈ dict[str, object], name ∈ str) → str:
    value ∈ str ← record.get(name, "")
    is_text ∈ bool ← isinstance(value, str)
    if is_text == False:
        sys.exit("MISSING_INPUT:" + name)
    if value == "":
        sys.exit("MISSING_INPUT:" + name)
    return value

def sha(path ∈ Path) → str:
    payload ∈ bytes ← path.read_bytes()
    result ∈ str ← hashlib.sha256(payload).hexdigest()
    return result

def exists(path ∈ Path) → bool:
    result ∈ bool ← path.is_file()
    return result

def absolute(path ∈ Path) → bool:
    result ∈ bool ← path.is_absolute()
    return result

def length(values ∈ list[str]) → int:
    result ∈ int ← len(values)
    return result

def main() → None:
    parser ∈ ArgumentParser ← ArgumentParser(description="Bounded identity-bound Android capture")
    parser.add_argument("--plan", required=True)
    parser.add_argument("--profile", required=True)
    parser.add_argument("--runtime", required=True)
    parser.add_argument("--output", required=True)
    args ∈ object ← parser.parse_args()
    plan_name ∈ str ← args.plan
    profile_name ∈ str ← args.profile
    runtime_name ∈ str ← args.runtime
    output_name ∈ str ← args.output
    plan ∈ dict[str, object] ← json.loads(Path(plan_name).read_text())
    profile ∈ dict[str, object] ← json.loads(Path(profile_name).read_text())
    runtime ∈ dict[str, object] ← json.loads(Path(runtime_name).read_text())
    package ∈ str ← field(plan, "package")
    valid ∈ bool ← bool(re.fullmatch(r"[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]*(\.[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]*)+", package))
    if valid == False:
        sys.exit("INVALID_PACKAGE")
    if package.__contains__("whatever"):
        sys.exit("PLACEHOLDER_PACKAGE")
    if field(plan, "permitted_actions") != "observe":
        sys.exit("UNSUPPORTED_ACTION: this version only observes")
    for key in ["target", "device_instance"]:
        if field(plan, key) != field(profile, key):
            sys.exit("PROFILE_CONFLICT:" + key)
    mode ∈ str ← field(runtime, "channel")
    if mode != "rish":
        if mode != "adb":
            sys.exit("WRONG_CONTEXT:Termux process is not Android shell authority")
    launcher ∈ Path ← Path(field(runtime, "launcher"))
    bound ∈ Path ← Path(field(runtime, "bounded_process"))
    if absolute(launcher) == False:
        sys.exit("MISSING_INPUT:absolute channel launcher")
    if exists(launcher) == False:
        sys.exit("LAUNCHER_MISSING")
    if sha(launcher) != field(runtime, "launcher_sha256"):
        sys.exit("LAUNCHER_DIGEST_MISMATCH")
    if exists(bound) == False:
        sys.exit("BOUNDED_RUNTIME_MISSING:no phone-side compilation")
    if sha(bound) != field(runtime, "bounded_process_sha256"):
        sys.exit("RUNTIME_DIGEST_MISMATCH")
    if mode == "rish":
        dex ∈ Path ← Path(field(runtime, "dex"))
        if exists(dex) == False:
            sys.exit("RISH_DEX_MISSING")
        if sha(dex) != field(runtime, "dex_sha256"):
            sys.exit("RISH_DEX_DIGEST_MISMATCH")
    root ∈ Path ← Path(output_name).resolve()
    root.mkdir(mode=448, parents=False, exist_ok=False)
    environment ∈ dict[str, str] ← dict()
    environment.__setitem__("PATH", "/system/bin:/usr/bin:/bin")
    environment.__setitem__("HOME", str(root))
    environment.__setitem__("LANG", "C")
    environment.__setitem__("TMPDIR", str(root))
    # Capture metadata starts incomplete and is updated after each bound stage.
    record ∈ dict[str, object] ← dict()
    for key in ["source_commit", "target", "device_instance", "package", "claim", "task_sha256"]:
        record.__setitem__(key, field(plan, key))
    source_name ∈ str ← sys._getframe().f_code.co_filename
    if sha(Path(source_name)) != field(plan, "task_sha256"):
        sys.exit("TASK_DIGEST_MISMATCH")
    record.__setitem__("state", "NOT_RUN")
    record.__setitem__("profile_sha256", sha(Path(profile_name)))
    record.__setitem__("physical_instance_binding", profile.get("instance_binding", "DECLARED_NOT_OBSERVED"))
    record.__setitem__("evidence_class", "bounded-observation")
    record.__setitem__("launcher_integrity", "FILE_DIGEST_MATCH")
    record.__setitem__("rish_dex_semantic_validity", "NOT_VERIFIED")
    record.__setitem__("shizuku_authorization", "NOT_OBSERVED")
    record.__setitem__("shizuku_service", "NOT_OBSERVED")
    record.__setitem__("adb_host_server", "NOT_OBSERVED")
    record.__setitem__("android_adb_connection", "NOT_OBSERVED")
    steps ∈ list[str] ← ["authority", "device-model", "firmware", "package", "apk-path", "apk-before", "version", "pid-before", "start-before", "observation", "pid-after", "start-after", "apk-after"]
    pid ← ""
    apk_path ← ""
    observation ∈ Path ← root.joinpath("observation.stdout")
    for step in steps:
        command ← "/system/bin/id -u"
        if step == "device-model":
            command ← "/system/bin/getprop ro.product.model"
        elif step == "firmware":
            command ← "/system/bin/getprop ro.build.fingerprint"
        elif step == "package":
            command ← "/system/bin/cmd package list packages " + package
        elif step == "apk-path":
            command ← "/system/bin/pm path " + package
        elif step == "apk-before":
            command ← "/system/bin/toybox sha256sum " + apk_path
        elif step == "apk-after":
            command ← "/system/bin/toybox sha256sum " + apk_path
        elif step == "version":
            command ← "/system/bin/dumpsys package " + package
        elif step == "pid-before":
            command ← "/system/bin/pidof " + package
        elif step == "pid-after":
            command ← "/system/bin/pidof " + package
        elif step == "start-before":
            command ← "/system/bin/cat /proc/" + pid + "/stat"
        elif step == "start-after":
            command ← "/system/bin/cat /proc/" + pid + "/stat"
        elif step == "observation":
            claim ∈ str ← field(plan, "claim")
            if claim == "frame-observation":
                command ← "/system/bin/screencap -p"
            elif claim == "crash-observation":
                command ← "/system/bin/logcat -d -t 200 --pid=" + pid
            elif claim == "zoom-state-observation":
                command ← "/system/bin/logcat -d -v raw -t 200 --pid=" + pid + " -s CrystalState:I"
            else:
                sys.exit("UNSUPPORTED_CLAIM")
        child_args ∈ list[str] ← [str(launcher), "-c", command]
        if mode == "adb":
            serial ∈ str ← field(runtime, "serial")
            valid_serial ∈ bool ← bool(re.fullmatch(r"[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]+", serial))
            if valid_serial == False:
                sys.exit("INVALID_ADB_SERIAL")
            child_args ← [str(launcher), "-s", serial, "exec-out", command]
        stdout ∈ Path ← root.joinpath(step + ".stdout")
        stderr ∈ Path ← root.joinpath(step + ".stderr")
        status ∈ Path ← root.joinpath(step + ".status.tsv")
        argv ∈ list[str] ← [str(bound), "5", "1048576", str(stdout), str(stderr), str(status), "--"]
        argv.extend(child_args)
        child ∈ CompletedProcess ← subprocess.run(argv, env=environment, cwd="/")
        code ∈ int ← child.returncode
        record.__setitem__("last_stage", step)
        record.__setitem__("producer_exit_code", str(code))
        record.__setitem__("state", "CAPTURE_FAILURE")
        record_text ∈ str ← json.dumps(record, sort_keys=True, indent=2)
        root.joinpath("capture.json").write_text(record_text)
        if code != 0:
            if step == "pid-before":
                if code == 1:
                    missing_pid ∈ bytes ← stdout.read_bytes()
                    if missing_pid == b"":
                        sys.exit("PID_ABSENT_OR_MULTIPLE:no running process")
            if step == "pid-after":
                if code == 1:
                    sys.exit("PROCESS_CHANGED_OR_DISAPPEARED")
            error ∈ str ← stderr.read_text(errors="replace")
            if error.__contains__("cannot connect to daemon"):
                sys.exit("ADB_HOST_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE")
            if error.__contains__("device offline") or error.__contains__("no devices/emulators found"):
                sys.exit("ANDROID_ADB_CONNECTION_UNAVAILABLE")
            if error.__contains__("Could not find or load main class") or error.__contains__("Error opening dex file"):
                sys.exit("RISH_LAUNCHER_OR_DEX_INVALID")
            if error.__contains__("Server is not running"):
                sys.exit("SHIZUKU_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE:DEX validity is separate")
            if error.__contains__("not authorized"):
                sys.exit("SHIZUKU_UNAUTHORIZED")
            if error.__contains__("Permission denied"):
                sys.exit("PERMISSION_FAILURE:" + step)
            if code == 124:
                sys.exit("CAPTURE_TIMEOUT:" + step)
            if code == 122:
                sys.exit("CAPTURE_OUTPUT_LIMIT:" + step)
            if code >= 128:
                sys.exit("CAPTURE_INTERRUPTED_OR_SIGNAL:" + step)
            sys.exit("PRODUCER_FAILURE:" + step + ":" + str(code))
        payload ∈ bytes ← stdout.read_bytes()
        text ∈ str ← payload.decode(errors="replace").strip()
        if step == "authority":
            if text != "2000":
                if text != "0":
                    sys.exit("WRONG_CONTEXT:Android shell/root authority required")
            record.__setitem__("effective_uid", text)
            record.__setitem__("channel", mode)
            if mode == "rish":
                record.__setitem__("shizuku_authorization", "BOUND_COMMAND_SUCCEEDED")
                record.__setitem__("shizuku_service", "BOUND_COMMAND_SUCCEEDED")
            else:
                record.__setitem__("android_adb_connection", "BOUND_COMMAND_SUCCEEDED")
                record.__setitem__("adb_host_server", "COMMAND_TRANSPORT_SUCCEEDED; startup cause UNKNOWN")
            # A successful authority command does not attribute service startup.
        elif step == "device-model":
            record.__setitem__("observed_model_property", text)
            expected_model ∈ str ← profile.get("expected_model_property", "UNKNOWN")
            if expected_model != "UNKNOWN":
                if expected_model != text:
                    sys.exit("PROFILE_CONFLICT:current model property")
        elif step == "firmware":
            record.__setitem__("observed_build_fingerprint", text)
            known_firmware ∈ str ← profile.get("firmware", "UNKNOWN")
            if known_firmware != "UNKNOWN":
                if known_firmware != text:
                    sys.exit("PROFILE_FRESHNESS:firmware changed")
        elif step == "package":
            packages ∈ list[str] ← text.splitlines()
            exact ← 0
            for row in packages:
                if row == "package:" + package:
                    exact ← exact + 1
            if exact != 1:
                sys.exit("PACKAGE_NOT_INSTALLED_OR_AMBIGUOUS")
        elif step == "apk-path":
            paths ∈ list[str] ← text.splitlines()
            if length(paths) != 1:
                sys.exit("APK_PATH_AMBIGUOUS:split APKs are not admitted")
            apk_path ∈ str ← text.removeprefix("package:")
            valid_path ∈ bool ← bool(re.fullmatch(r"/data/app/[A-Za-z0-9_./=+~-]+/base\.apk", apk_path))
            if valid_path == False:
                sys.exit("APK_PATH_UNSUPPORTED")
        elif step == "apk-before":
            if text == "":
                sys.exit("INSTALLED_ARTIFACT_IDENTITY_UNAVAILABLE")
            installed ∈ str ← text.split().__getitem__(0)
            if installed != field(plan, "apk_sha256"):
                sys.exit("INSTALLED_ARTIFACT_MISMATCH")
            record.__setitem__("installed_apk_sha256", installed)
        elif step == "apk-after":
            if text == "":
                sys.exit("ARTIFACT_IDENTITY_DISAPPEARED")
            current_apk ∈ str ← text.split().__getitem__(0)
            if current_apk != field(plan, "apk_sha256"):
                sys.exit("ARTIFACT_CHANGED_DURING_CAPTURE")
        elif step == "version":
            versions ∈ list[str] ← re.findall(r"versionCode=([0-9]+)", text)
            if length(versions) != 1:
                sys.exit("VERSION_IDENTITY_AMBIGUOUS")
            record.__setitem__("version_code", versions.__getitem__(0))
        elif step == "pid-before":
            valid_pid ∈ bool ← bool(re.fullmatch(r"[1-9][0-9]*", text))
            if valid_pid == False:
                sys.exit("PID_ABSENT_OR_MULTIPLE")
            pid ← text
            record.__setitem__("pid_before", pid)
        elif step == "pid-after":
            if text != pid:
                sys.exit("PROCESS_CHANGED_OR_DISAPPEARED")
            record.__setitem__("pid_after", text)
        elif step == "start-before":
            stat_tail ∈ str ← text.rpartition(")").__getitem__(2)
            stat_fields ∈ list[str] ← stat_tail.split()
            if length(stat_fields) < 20:
                sys.exit("PROCESS_START_UNAVAILABLE")
            record.__setitem__("process_start_before", stat_fields.__getitem__(19))
        elif step == "start-after":
            after_tail ∈ str ← text.rpartition(")").__getitem__(2)
            after_fields ∈ list[str] ← after_tail.split()
            if length(after_fields) < 20:
                sys.exit("PROCESS_START_UNAVAILABLE")
            before_start ∈ str ← record.get("process_start_before", "")
            after_start ∈ str ← after_fields.__getitem__(19)
            if before_start != after_start:
                sys.exit("PROCESS_CHANGED:pid reused")
            record.__setitem__("process_start_after", after_start)
        elif step == "observation":
            if payload == b"":
                if field(plan, "claim") == "zoom-state-observation":
                    sys.exit("INSTRUMENTATION_GAP:CrystalState emitted no state")
                sys.exit("EMPTY_OBSERVATION")
            if field(plan, "claim") == "zoom-state-observation":
                selected ← ""
                log_lines ∈ list[str] ← text.splitlines()
                for line in log_lines:
                    if line.startswith('{"schema":"crystal-state-v1"'):
                        selected ← line
                if selected == "":
                    sys.exit("INSTRUMENTATION_GAP:no CrystalState JSON snapshot")
                snapshot ∈ dict[str, object] ← json.loads(selected)
                expected_session ∈ str ← pid + "-" + field(record, "process_start_before")
                if field(snapshot, "session") != expected_session:
                    sys.exit("STALE_TELEMETRY:process session mismatch")
                observation ∈ Path ← root.joinpath("application-state.json")
                observation.write_text(selected + "\n")
            record.__setitem__("observation_path", str(observation))
            record.__setitem__("observation_sha256", sha(observation))
    record.__setitem__("state", "CAPTURED")
    complete_text ∈ str ← json.dumps(record, sort_keys=True, indent=2)
    root.joinpath("capture.json").write_text(complete_text)
    print(str(root.joinpath("capture.json")))

main()
